# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# setup: bigcopy
# Copying a large file costs the loop nothing.
#
# The file engine copies a whole file inside one step, and a step ran on
# the loop: a copy of anything large was the desk gone for the copy.
# Here a file of a gigabyte and a half is copied into its own folder
# and, while the copy runs, the loop is asked how long its turns got.
wait 12
expect-operation idle
key a ctrl
wait 3
key c ctrl
wait 3
key v ctrl
wait 3
expect-operation of
expect-under turns 100
note and the copy still finishes, and the copy is there
wait 600
expect-operation idle
expect-read /tmp/trk_script big.bin copy
quit
